# boulder_b: a boulder (BUILD_PLAN S5 brief B5): a rounded slate (2) body
# with its top-right facet in glacier blue (3), the facet's edge a clean
# diagonal, and an ink (0) ground line. Drawn row by row as whole shapes,
# so no lone pixel reads as an eye. The anchor, 0,0, is the middle of its
# ground line. 9 wide, 6 tall.
C 2  L -1,-5 0,-5  L -2,-4 0,-4  L -3,-3 0,-3  L -4,-2 1,-2  L -4,-1 2,-1
C 3  L 1,-5 2,-5  L 1,-4 3,-4  L 1,-3 4,-3  L 2,-2 4,-2  L 3,-1 4,-1
C 0  L -4,0 4,0
